    "description": "Worked as part of a team to create periscope software for US Navy submarines.  My accomplishments include:\n\n- Designed and developed software component to display multiple live and recorded video streams originating from submarine periscopes.\n- Implemented GPU image processing algorithms for video streams.\n- Utilized and adapted complex open source software for video decoding.\n- Experience in all aspects of the software development lifecycle and software version control.",
